            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>PIK3R1 mutations cause syndromic insulin resistance with lipoatrophy. Thauvin-Robinet et al. (2013) The American Journal of Human Genetics 93: 141-149 SHORT syndrome with partial lipodystrophy due to impaired phosphatidylinositol 3 kinase signalling. Chudasama et al. (2013) The American Journal of Human Genetics 93: 150-157 Mutations in PIK3R1 cause SHORT syndrome. Dyment et al. (2013) The American Journal of Human Genetics 93: 158-166.</AbstractText>
